    "description": "# DL-1: Deal Object + Core Details\n\n_Establish the foundational Deal object and the core fields every deal needs, regardless of type._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Deal Name\n\n* Vertical (picklist)\n* Operator (lookup)\n* Deal Status (picklist)\n* Partner (lookup)\n* Priority Tier (picklist): Primary, Secondary\n* Market Country\n* Market Province/State\n* Default Redirect URL\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* The Deal object itself was largely already built before this build pass. This ticket ties it to the Link object (DL-5) and adds fields identified in later discussions.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: DL-1 (Deal Record User Stories doc).\n* Foundational — DL-2 through DL-5 all build on this object.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Deal Record User Stories — Google Doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IIfaPIol2HmX8v09gw0SKQyCuoHTiwrJxdDNc7qtvB8/edit)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 39:50 (confirms Deal object mostly pre-built, ties to Link)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2390)\n* Dependencies: None — foundational.\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Deal record documentation review.\n\n",
